# Sacred Boon on your own creature (CR 615.7, 603.7): a shield of the next 3 damage, then at the beginning of the next end step
# a +0/+1 counter for each 1 damage it prevented. Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2) is Shocked twice on Bot2's turn 2, Sacred Boon cast
# in response to the first: the first Shock is prevented whole (2), the second only in part (1 of 2, the shield's last) and 1
# is dealt - the shield counts damage, not events. At the end step of the same turn (the next one to begin) the Ornithopter
# gets 3 counters, as one placement, its power unchanged.

